# Vuln-fix round 2026-05-cve-sweep — exception list.
#
# The CVEs below are flagged on github.com/tektoncd/pipeline. The fix exists
# in tektoncd/pipeline v1.11.x, but adopting v1.11.x in this repo requires
# bumping k8s.io/client-go to v0.36+, which is incompatible with the rest of
# the katanomi/* release-0.14 stack (currently on k8s v0.29.15) and would
# remove API packages relied on by sibling repos (katanomi/knative-pkg
# replace directive, others).
#
# These exceptions are intentionally scoped to the smallest CVE set possible.
# When the wider release-0.14 -> release-0.15 jump moves k8s to v0.36+, these
# exceptions should be removed and tektoncd/pipeline bumped to v1.11.x.
#
# Tracked in case study:
#   ~/.my-knowledge/work/alauda-kb/cases/2026-05-18-katanomi-core-vuln-fix-stacked-images.md
